"enter        send the message · open the focused block                          "
"shift+enter  newline (ctrl+j · alt+enter · \ enter)                             "
"esc          sheet → card → dropdown → interrupt                                "
"esc esc      rewind to an earlier turn                                          "
"ctrl+c       interrupt · clear input · twice to exit                            "
